&lt;p&gt;
	Following our recent food hygiene inspection, we received a 1-star rating, due to historical issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	Since the inspection, we have completed a comprehensive action plan to address all matters raised. This has included a full deep clean of the premises, repairs and replacement of equipment where required, enhanced food safety procedures, and additional staff training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	We have implemented all necessary improvements and will be applying for a re-rating inspection, where we look forward to demonstrating the high standards now in place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	We would like to thank our customers for their continued support. We remain fully committed to providing safe, high-quality food and excellent service at all times&lt;/p&gt;
